        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hushayi gahuta Absalomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwayeesha Ahitofeli Absalomu, “Nung' daloat fih sagalamnyooji damaniyeenya, ak gaydanung' ghwaat geeshta Dawdi eaweani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydang'uchi niny damanda nipra nea ning'arng'ariit, ak ghaanung' ghang'ut muuwda; ak gaygamng'aw buuneesean mideawa. Ak gaydabwar sugoocheanda ak ghwahit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gaydaaghuumu buuneesean headaang'u gawuurji gidawuniida sibeeda ghoah heeda siyeadaanyi. Ang'iing'i gigasayi eaweespa siyagi, ak gaygoobiitpiit buuneesean nea gaba seayu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamwas Absalomu sea gweargwa sean bea Israeli girgweageeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Absalomu ak gwayeesha, “Guursiina eara Hushayi bea eemeeda Arkite, ak geayiinyi gichea gwarugu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu Hushayi heeda Absalomu, ghwalamda Absalomu ak gwayeesha niny, “Ghayi gwayi Ahitofeli; gajeesna gidaghayi rugu? Amaweeda girgu ang'iing'i.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Hushayi Absalomu, “Eanean girgweageeda rugu Ahitofeli mii mwahida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikta Hushayi gwayi, “Ginali gideaba gweanu sea fugaaschi gwandeawa uurjeenga, ak ea nyareeseadi, aba jeesinga nyaawa, gawuurji idamooda siireat dayeagaaschi aba dareabeeta. Nuut, gweanu ea daruus aba ng'ucheeda; maygwaluudayi eawa sea buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, eara ghamneawa nifuy geaw aba jeemba shoamanagi, ghana aba hich nuut. Iidu nea goobeedeayi buuneeda aba ng'eesiinda madeeda, gaygwayi siida wassean iing'shi, ‘Sibwar fuga saang'a aba jeeda fuga aat geeshta Absalomu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara siida mwaay, uurji gurooroadaanyi guroorooda ng'adiida, gayghabeal muuchi; aba gideaba ghwanal buuneesean bea Israeli gideaba gweanu siida mwaayi, ea gideaba fuga mideawa ea meanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak girgweageedeanyu ea gideaba gayghabwat geat buuneesean bea Israeli gil aba headaang'u, ghang'eada Dani ea ghwahita Beer-sheba, ea gwadeena eemeeda iseaskweanda ghuuta basooda, ak giideayeewi geaw ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeanyasana heeda mida wassean, ak gajeepisiinda niny gidabitiisiinda rahooda badayda ng'eanyiida; ak ea manda siida jea ghoabit niny sea fugaaschi sean mideawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iiriteaysa mujiini, abeeda gaygweada buuneesean bea Israeli mareamarajeega jeedeaba mujiineedida, ak geengiirji ea ghwahita moangoachi, ak ea manda lagheaneanagi jea ghoabit jea eanyasa hoowa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayi Absalomu sea buuneesean bea Israeli, “Girgweageeda Hushayi bea eemeeda Arkite aamiy ea ghang'al girgweageeda Ahitofeli.” Aba gideaba nimwaar NG'UTAMIIDA niny ghwajoar girgweageeda miy bea Ahitofeli, ak abeeda gweadu NG'UTAMIIDA gidamuy badayda Absalomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dawdi geamiin gheang'da ak gamng'aw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwalamda Hushayi ak gwayeesha Sadoki sea Abiyatariheeda was ashoohoodiga, “Girgweageeda rukusa Absalomu ea fuga hees bea Israeli ea girgweageeda adayda Ahitofeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi lamwaja ajeaksiina eerukusa Dawdi, gideaba ‘adiidu gili eaweani aba ghuuta bunooda ghealooda lach bugusta dareapcheeda, ak giduurji sean aghaawa; aba gideaba gajiidu geang'waay sugoocheanda sea buuneadaanyi ak geabwar gameewa.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yonatan sea Ahimasi ghoamuughu aba gheang'deenda Enrogeli; ak gabadiini huda gadiyeeda gwarukwiisa saawa, ak gaweay saawa gwarukusa sugoocheanda siguura Dawdi; aba gideaba meegassa gaweay jeeda mujiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwadeagu orjeanagi saawa, ak gwarukusa Absalomu; ak gaweay duwaawi nea ghwalamwajaada, ak ghwahita gheesiida aba Bahurimu, mideawa healadeeda aba jeeda hilgweandaanyi; ak ghoabita jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu gatmooda ganyamda ak gwadukuteawa ghuuta healadeeda, ak ghoabwarghaan booga aba uhuuda; ak ea manda gisinal aba ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwahidu fuga gadiyeeda Absalomu heeda gatmooda aba ghoah, gwayeesha saawa niny, “Gwanda yeenu Ahimasi ea Yonatan?” Ghwalamda gatmooda ak gwayeesha saawa, “Niighaawa ghealooda beega.” Iidu nea geegasa ak ea meanyasa saawa, ghwayam geat gabiikta Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea niweay fugiga, gwascheeng'na buuneeda jeeda healadeeda, ak gaweay gwarukusa sugoocheanda siguura Dawdi. Ak geeyeesha Dawdi, “Ng'eada, ak gilamwajaadi aghaawana beega; aba gideaba nih girugu Ahitofeli aba badahuukeagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Dawdi, sea buuneesean mideawa, ak ghoaghaawa Yordani; iidu nea gaweeshiit ea manda eara siyagi siipuut mii ghoaghaawa Yordani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah Ahitofeli gideaba geaheawa girgweageadaanyi, ghaghu digeadaanyi, ak gawa ghoah was mujiineadaanyi. Ak gwasisin gheanyi, ak ghwarata geaw; ak ghami, ak geebung'sa jeeda bung'eeda ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghwaan Dawdi ea ghwahidu heeda Mahanaimu. Ak ghoaghaawa Absalomu Yordani sea buuneesean bea Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanu Absalomu ak ghwanung' ghoah Amasa hawunda goombal shirikara gawa hoorgeeda Yoabu. Nea Amasa ea orjeeda siida siguura Itrahi bea eemeeda Shumwaheeli, ghayi geena Abigaeli was hudeaba Nahashi, huda geenyea Seruya, was gheamata Yoabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gooduuw Israeli ea Absalomu aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghwahita Dawdi Mahanaimu, ghapka roonyeeda Shoebi was orjeeda Nahashi, leabu mujiineeda Raba mida ng'eanyiida Amoni, sea Makiri orjeeda Amieli leabu Lodebari, sea Barsilayi, leabu Rogelimu mida ng'eanyiida Gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gweadu bulaleenga jea eabwat, ea haragweaka, ea dahuundiga, ea ngaano, ea shayiiri, ea dearanga, ea booga sibeash, ea loosiida ea sagharooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea maleeda ea nagheedeesh ea gisilleanda ea nagheeda heasaat bea deeda ghwaak Dawdi sea buuneadaanyi mideawa; aba gideaba gwayi, “Buuneeda gabearji jalooda ak ea nibur nea niyaak muwoash aba dareapcheeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.17.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
